    <!-- ABOUT SCREEN -->
    <string name="about_us">About us</string>
    <string name="amanogawa" translatable="false">Amanogawa</string>
    <string name="amanogawa_about">" – this is a Ukrainian anime community… Ukrainian anime dubbing. Quite logical. We translate and voice your favorite titles, manage social networks, cut videos for YouTube, make a podcast and have our own discord server. On January 12, 2020, a team called Amanogawa began its history, which means "Milky Way" in Japanese💫 Ambitious people gathered here who were passionate about anime and voice acting and saw each other's potential, which will help them move through the thorns to the stars and beyond! Amanogawa is a team that currently includes 10 male and female translators, 4 translators, a publisher responsible for partnerships - in short, this is a lot of people who work at night and on weekends, and in their sleep they still come up with ideas for posts and Tik Tok."</string>
    <string name="mission">"Mission: "</string>
    <string name="translators_mission">don\'t die when the series has 400 lines of text</string>
    <string name="what_are_they_doing">"What was forgotten in Amanogawa? "</string>
    <string name="translators_do">They translate anime so that you immerse yourself in the atmosphere of the title and, where necessary, laugh at adapted jokes and memes.</string>
    <string name="dabers_mission">sound to shoot Tik-Toks about it</string>
    <string name="dabers_do">They voice anime day and night, constantly improve diction skills, acting skills, lip sync and other things with clever names.</string>
    <string name="sound">Sound</string>
    <string name="sound_mission">catch zen when someone has put the accent wrong again</string>
    <string name="sound_do">They clean the sound and make effects so that you are completely immersed in the events of the anime. And they also monitor the quality of dubbing.</string>
    <string name="main_target">Amanogawa\'s main goal?</string>
    <string name="main_target_val">" Make cool."</string>
    <string name="our_plans">"Our plans? There are many of them, so subscribe to us in "</string>
    <string name="telegram_link">Telegram</string>
    <string name="after_telegramLinkText">" and watch us grow. And the Amanogawa community is the audience! Thousands of fans, whom we try to fill with high-quality content, have a little fun and not leave their favorite titles without dubbing, even during the war. We are infinitely grateful to everyone for their moral and financial support, because this is exactly what helps us move forward and serve the Armed Forces.</string>
